#. Description of the plugin
#: catcode-order-notifications-with-telegram-for-woocommerce.php
msgid ""
"Instant WooCommerce order notifications in Telegram: new orders, status "
"changes, failed payments, low stock and leads from site forms (Contact Form "
"7). Flexible message templates, multiple chats and topics, and a delivery "
"log."
msgstr ""

